Smallest integer not yet present in the sequence such that the sum of the first a(n) terms of the sequence is a prime.

The 72 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A180405

